{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/635149-do-you-want-to-playtest-changeling-the-lost-second-edition","id":635149,"title":"Do You Want to Playtest Changeling the Lost Second Edition?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-21T16:59:56-07:00","id":635149,"title":"Do You Want to Playtest Changeling the Lost Second Edition?","content":"So, here's what's going on. I had a playtest group of three, with some complications of schedule. Three's about the number I like to work with, three to five. Anyways, one of them is dropping because his schedule finally became too much. In and of itself, this isn't too much of a problem-I have a guy who's hopping to get in and I trust him to get it done.<br /> <br /> <i>BUT!</i> I anticipate a second player dropping out because of his schedule(He's screwed us over more than the other guy, honestly), and that leaves me with two. On top of that, Dave is, as you know, putting in Redlines, and writers are already putting up their second drafts.<br /> <br /> Second drafts are what we playtest with. So I'm running out of time with my pre-building phase.<br /> <br /> SO! I'm looking for a player who is available to playtest this game on Saturdays starting at 6 PM Mountain Standard Time, preferably on a weekly basis, and ideally gives good notes and plays cool characters. We'll be playing in Paris with the court system I've set up in the Court Creation thread (I'm beginning work on them again!). I have a set of standards that, if I decide I want to game with you, that I expect you to meet. If I want you in, I'll contact you in a private message and then send you a couple of e-mails with the particulars. I will need you to be comfortable with video chat, as we test over Google Hangouts.<br /> <br /> So, if you've ever wanted to play in one of my games, if you want to look at Changeling Second before anyone else, if you want to participate in the refinement of this amazing game, tell me so here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T17:06:56-07:00","id":635174,"title":"","content":"If it wasn't for the fact that I am still learning how to play Changelings and I am going to be busy for the next few months I would be happy to beta test.<br /> <br /> Sorry that I can't help but I do hope you find someone.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> We'll be playing in Paris with the court system I've set up in the Court Creation thread (I'm beginning work on them again!) </div> </div> </div>Would it be alright if I looked at them to see if I might use them for the campaign I am currently working on? My campaign takes place in Spokane WA.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;A dark shape crawls out from your closet. At first it looks like it has a large zipper for a mouth, however as it gets closer you soon realize that it isn't a zipper at all but rows of sharp yellow teeth!&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","name":"Werescythe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T17:10:49-07:00","id":635182,"title":"","content":"Yeah, sure. I put it up so people could tinker with it and do what they will with it. When I get the refined version up, that'll be made available for people to play with as well.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Warning, it is a series of posts. I'll see if I can collect them here.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=559072#post559072\">The Rose Courts of Paris</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=572106#post572106\">The House of Regret</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=572920#post572920\">The Wayward</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=573070#post573070\">Into the Depths</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=573370#post573370\">The Final Duel and the Marriage</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=575415#post575415\">The Sovereigns and the Score of the Spheres</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=576033#post576033\">The Duels and the Courted</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/551489-court-creation?p=577649#post577649\">1,001 Problems but a Belle Ain't One of Them</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 08-21-2015, 09:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T18:09:25-07:00","id":635281,"title":"","content":"I have an idea and I am interested but I don't really know how to make the character work because I'm not at all familiar with french culture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T18:14:59-07:00","id":635294,"title":"","content":"I'm American. I've never taken a class on French, never done a social studies class on it, never been to Paris. Everything I've learned, I've learned in anticipation of this game and others set in Paris(I'm using it to set up other things).<br /> <br /> Lack of knowledge is not a barrier. We're learning it together. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T18:57:38-07:00","id":635316,"title":"","content":"How long would the game be going? I would be available every Saturday through September 12th.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5695-aceofalmonds","name":"AceOfAlmonds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5695_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"323"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T19:20:29-07:00","id":635322,"title":"","content":"That's certainly a catch: The game properly begins when we have second drafts. When do we get second drafts?<br /> <br /> Well, like I said, Dave's redlining material now, and two writers have already responded with their second ones, but in a nutshell, it's a still some ways off, and I can't give a solid dateline for when the game is starting. It might start next week(unlikely), but it could start on September 12th or even start on October 12th(I think it going that late is unlikely).<br /> <br /> Part of my new intentions are to start when I have Chapters 1 through 4 in Second Draft, since chapters 5 and 7 are for me anyways and I don't need them to run the game(although I am using rules from Chapter 7, the first draft'll do fine until we get the second draft), although Dave is free to tell me to do otherwise. But even with the earlier start, I can't give a deadline. Also, beyond that I don't quite know how much time I'll have to get shit done either, because the hard deadline for playtest input is dependent on, you guessed it, when we get the second drafts.<br /> <br /> Now, it's not like the time is going to go waste. City Creation ended up being my project, sure, but I have a few other things that we'll be building as a group, and I still am taking input in on the Freehold of Paris, particularly from my group. Point is, we will still be <i>doing</i> things before we get the second drafts. But that's still an indeterminate amount of time.<br /> <br /> So, too long, didn't read: it depends on when we get the second drafts, and I don't wholly know when that is. We will be still be doing things in the meantime, though, in preparation for the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T19:29:15-07:00","id":635323,"title":"","content":"Gotcha. I'd love to volunteer, but I can't commit to that time (my own Changeling game will start running every other Saturday). Good luck, and thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5695-aceofalmonds","name":"AceOfAlmonds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5695_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"323"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T19:43:50-07:00","id":635354,"title":"","content":"I would love to be involved in one of your games, if you'll have me. The timing works well as I'm also on Mountain Time, and though I work on Saturdays, 5:15 is the latest I'm ever there and the drive home takes 20 minutes tops. Video chat isn't my favorite, but I'd happily deal with that for an opportunity to be involved in playtesting, and to be in one of your games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 08-21-2015, 10:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-21T20:17:27-07:00","id":635365,"title":"","content":"I made the decision earlier tonight that even if my other player doesn't drop, I'm actually very keen on expanding to four players. So either way we have space.<br /> <br /> Also, Charlaquin has applied for my game. <i>Yes</i>.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I'm still probably gonna wait until Monday before sending out the PM's, as a note.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 08-21-2015, 11:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T00:07:09-07:00","id":635487,"title":"","content":"Damn you timezones, I'm afraid I'll have to decline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T01:16:54-07:00","id":635510,"title":"","content":"Damn wish I could be of service but between a lack of confidence, a lack of experience, and a lack of good note taking ability I am afraid I wouldn't be of much help *sighs* C'est la vie","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/24296274/BeastThePrimordial.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":6566,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6566-draca","user":"Draca","date":". 08-22-2015, 04:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6566-draca","name":"Draca","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6566_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T08:23:21-07:00","id":635821,"title":"","content":"THe only one I care about is a lack of good note taking ability. Think you can overcome that?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, yes, my third playtester has drop, so we have two openings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 08-22-2015, 12:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T11:20:19-07:00","id":636063,"title":"","content":"I wish I could put myself forward, but gah, the timing is horrid. I could, bar unexpected inconveniences, attend the session schedule no problem, but by the time it starts my attention will most likely be caught in with IRL responsibilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T12:00:56-07:00","id":636154,"title":"","content":"NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!<br /> <br /> Damn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T12:26:44-07:00","id":636169,"title":"","content":"How would we play? Over Skype?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":